{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18402","headline":"赋得春风扇微和 · 陈九流","name":"赋得春风扇微和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"喜见阳和至，遥知橐龠功。\n迟迟散南陌，褭褭逐东风。\n暗入芳园里，潜吹草木中。\n兰荪才有绿，桃杏未成红。\n已觉寒光尽，还看淑气通。\n由来荣与悴，今日发应同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈九流","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18402.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18402","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}